Description: desktop environment in the style of Windows 2000 and XP
 XeonDesktop is a Wayland desktop that looks and works like Windows 2000
 and Windows XP: a wlroots compositor with Classic, Luna and Watercolor
 window frames, a taskbar with the Windows 2000, XP and 7 Start menus,
 Display Properties, Task Manager, System Properties, a file manager, Lock
 Computer with screen savers, and a polkit authentication agent.
 .
 Windows' fonts are replaced by the closest free ones: DejaVu Sans
 Condensed for Tahoma, Source Sans 3 for Trebuchet MS and Roboto Condensed
 for Franklin Gothic; the real fonts are used if they're installed.
